                                    <data value="Comm. from Sergeant Kamar" name="journalEntryTitle" />
                                    <data value="Comm. from Sergeant Kamar: &quot;Kamar here. So, they're in the Mining Sector? That's bad. It's one of the more important sectors in the entire city. Lots of critical systems to sabotage. We need to figure out which ones they've tampered with. Head to that sector's control room and use its equipment to diagnose which systems have been sabotaged.&quot;" name="journalEntryDescription" />
